      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在紧张的气氛中打出了冲球，球散落在台球桌各处。\n……接下来就是我该做的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49bb229612068a4279b01071e6fef78a5e340e0d9ffdb6309f81a254789039e",
