    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4efa4f33976891175aab517d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当她说出“世界”的瞬间，我的内心非常激动。\n我梦想着──那咆哮声能够响彻全世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeddf913e662eb419896b410f633fa05a8e765f0f4f7121d8c357c3ac11a7663",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
